WEBVTT

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:30.556
and just really not a care
in the world and having fun.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:34.586
To see that you're so important to them

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.038
is really inspiring,

00:13:37.062 --> 00:13:39.294
to be able to go back in
and sit down and say,

00:13:39.318 --> 00:13:42.028
"OK, I'm going to work
on this really hard thing,

00:13:42.052 --> 00:13:44.608
or I'm going to have
this really hard conversation,

00:13:44.632 --> 00:13:48.965
because I have 40 kids out there
who are depending on me for that."

00:13:48.989 --> 00:13:54.006
(Music)

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:56.636
AG: Think about
your experiences with burnout.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:14:00.266
What's your version of hanging out
with kids at recess?